From 39eb70d5baa21a987693c7894a67040be5fafdb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@buttzeppelin>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:02:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-223: ZepModernM2 additive-overlay combiner

Source shader effects 21/33/35 are marked (batch flag 0x80) and drawn with WXL's compiled
overlay vertex/pixel shaders on a rigid (one-bone) section; skinned sections keep the base
pair (the shader reads no bone weights). ZEP_M2_OVERLAY_OFF disables it for comparisons.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ByrZ7GxoHC9wfGdkRwtqCX
